window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I broke the cardinal rule and slept with my sister’s best friend.</p> <p>Granted, I’d just found out that I was now a single father to a three-year-old little girl and was low on willpower.</p> <p>It should also be noted that there’s been sexual tension between us for years. There’s no way it would be a surprise if anyone in our small town found out. That is if we were telling people, which we’re not.</p> <p>We’re in agreement to keep our affair a secret, especially since neither one of us do relationships.</p> <p>You’ve probably figured it out already, but things didn’t go as planned.</p>"; 
